rewards.message:
{Treasure Chest}

The scroll turns out to be a spell of the first or second circle. You put it in your backpack.

You could instead burn the scroll for 45 spell points.

{Treasure Chest}

You burn the scroll and draw the released magic into your spell points. Your hero gains 45 spell points on top of what he already has.

You could instead keep the scroll.

